label Greeting
if {Transaction_GreetingVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Magandang araw. Just stopping by between errands for Tatay.
else:
	Brahim: Hello! Nothing beats a quiet walk through Karimlan before the sun gets too high.

if {Global_HighPriceActive}:
	Brahim: Ang mahal naman... [pause=0.3] Isang araw na ulam na rin ang presyo nito.

[end_timeline]

label Talk
if {Transaction_TalkVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Do you happen to have {Transaction_ItemWants}?
else:
	Brahim: I'm hoping to pick up {Transaction_ItemWants} for the house today.
- Coming right up.
	Brahim: Salamat. No hurry at all.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, we're out.
	Brahim: That's alright—I'll check back another time. Take care!
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]


label Partial
Brahim: Salamat! I'll still need {Transaction_ItemWants} too, if you have it.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_SatisfyVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Just what I needed. Salamat!
else:
	Brahim: Always a pleasure stopping by your store. Take it easy!
if {Global_TipActive}:
	Brahim: Aba, that was quite cheap. Keep the change po!
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
if {Transaction_WrongItemVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Oh, I think that's a different one—I was looking for {Transaction_ItemWants}.
else:
	Brahim: Almost! I actually needed {Transaction_ItemWants} today.
[end_timeline]
